Not taken: tools/mesa/air/air_run.c (a test harness that draws on the Adreno), every .py tool,
prebuilt/ (binaries), the Panfrost, freedreno and ir3 patches (another GPU), tools/mesa/redwood-drm
(Jesvi's libdrm stand-in: on the A56 Mesa reaches the GPU through its Darwin vdrm), xnu/, and no
Apple metallib, shared-cache extract or capture.

